sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant FS as Firestore chunks
  participant Feed as ChunkFeed (phone)
  participant Sync as IndexSync (phone)
  participant Emb as embed_texts
  participant Idx as LocalIndex (phone)
  Note over Feed: delta: chunks with updatedAt after last sync minus 10 min<br/>full: on first run and every 7 days
  FS->>Feed: changed chunks and tombstones (listener)
  Feed->>Sync: batch of changes (+ full ID set on a full sync)
  Sync->>Emb: new chunk texts, batches of 50
  Emb-->>Sync: unit vectors (nothing stored in the cloud)
  Sync->>Idx: add and update rows, remove tombstoned chunks
  opt full sync from the server
    Sync->>Idx: drop anything not in the full ID set
  end
  Sync->>Idx: persist chunks.json + vectors.bin (temp file, atomic rename)
  Note over Idx: search and ask now run locally<br/>wiped on sign-out
